                      Jenkins freestyle job
   It's a job which allows you build any type of project.
                - maven project
                - Graddle project
                - Shell script
                - Ant project
   It is a default project in jenkins. 
   This is not pausable hence not good to use in projection meaning you cannot pause it for a human input
   It does not keep state of a job, hence you cannot restart where a job ended
   With afreestyle job once its running and the controller restarts the job end, wheras with the pipeline job if the controller restart it picks up from where 
      it ended.

  Its a sequential set of task defined by a user

       steps included in a jenkins job include the following
            - retrieving the latest source code from the version control
            - compiling the soucre code
            - running unit tests
            - building and storing the artifacts
            - notifying the end users of the outcome of a build

